description         Optical drive firmware backup and flasher for freemkv.
long_description    Back up, inspect and flash the firmware of optical drives (as used for \
                    freemkv). This installs the freemkv Flash and freemkv Modify apps and the \
                    freemkv-flash, freemkv-fw and freemkv-crossflash command line tools.
homepage            https://github.com/freemkv/freemkv-firmware

